AS is required to name an expression, so SELECT page views is a syntax error at views.
-- dynaflux/queries.sql --
-- name: PageList :many
SELECT page views
FROM page_daily
WHERE page = {page:String};
-- want --
dynaflux/queries.sql:2:13: error DF1101
